  message: "Fixed by dispatch:F2 (PR merged as 08e458c2c6). The default flips from --seeds entrypoints to --seeds production (entrypoints + exported public API) AND a stderr note fires on the defaulted path. Behavioral evidence (production-path tests in test_cli_dead_code.py): test_default_is_production_with_buckets_and_warn asserts summary.seeds_mode=='production', seeds_defaulted True, and 'defaulting to --seeds production' on stderr; on the F2 fixture the production default flags {tested_fn, truly_dead} while the strict entrypoint-only cohort would flag 4 (disclosed as entrypoint_only_dead). On self-analysis the default moves ~89% -> ~52%. The strict entrypoint-only view survives as an explicit --seeds entrypoints (unchanged) and as the entrypoint_only_dead disclosure bucket."  # 7871
